ol to plan and track tasks throughout the conversation.\n\n# Code References\n\nWhen referencing specific functions or pieces of code include the pattern `file_path:line_number` to allow the user to easily navigate to the source code location.\n\n<example>\nuser: Where are errors from the client handled?\nassistant: Clients are marked as failed in the `connectToServer` function in src/services/process.ts:712.\n</example>\n"},{"role":"system","content":"Here is some useful information about the environment you are running in:\n<env>\n  Working directory: /tmp/formal-ai-issue-835.LEyBFs\n  Is directory a git repo: yes\n  Platform: linux\n  Today's date: Sun Aug 02 2026\n</env>\n\n<files>\n  .formal-ai/\n\tgeneral-change-plan.lino\ndialog-logs/\n\tdialog_6c759a895ca47bfc.jsonl\n\tdialog_ea7480df30703587.conversation.jsonl\n\tdialog_ea7480df30703587.jsonl\nmemory.lino\nmemory.lino.lock\nprovider-safety-boundary.md\nREADME.md\n</files>"},{"role":"user","content":"Create file provider-safety-boundary.md containing Confirmed child-safety hash matches must come from an authorized provider receipt, suppress local derivatives, stop ordinary detector execution, and escalate through the provider's reporting channel."},{"role":"assistant","content":"Let me update .formal-ai/general-change-plan.lino for you.","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_42046f036ad00588","type":"function","function":{"name":"write","arguments":"{\"content\":\"general_change_plan\\n  id \\\"general_change_plan_00c186c9c77f9a36\\\"\\n  execution_mode \\\"literal_file\\\"\\n  goal \\\"Create file provider-safety-boundary.md containing Confirmed child-safety hash matches must come from an authorized provider receipt, suppress local derivatives, stop ordinary detector execution, and escalate through the provider's reporting channel.\\\"\\n  target \\\"provider-safety-boundary.md\\\"\\n  step 1\\n    capability \\\"Write\\\"\\n    action \\\"append the composed plan to .formal-ai/general-change-plan.lino\\\"\\n    expect